Unmodified cursor assets from GNOME Shell51.0.
Exact source and file hashes are recorded in UPSTREAM.json.
SVG attribution/license declarations are preserved inside each source SVG.
The upstream repository license is retained in UPSTREAM-COPYING.
Local index.theme supports standard theme lookup.
Installed privately under /usr/share/tuna-desktop/icons, without replacing
files owned by the system Adwaita icon theme package.
